OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA chilly
OL,6,Fnight to come bringing a risk of
OL,7,Fisolated frost patches especially
OL,8,Funder clearer skies inland. More in
OL,9,Fthe way of cloud with a chance of
OL,10,Fshowers along the north and west
OL,11,Fcoasts. Light northerly winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA bright start to Saturday,
OL,14,Fwith long sunny spells but patchy
OL,15,Fcloud bubbling up by afternoon.
OL,16,FFeeling chilly compared to recently in
OL,17,Fa light northerly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
