OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAgain,
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine on offer to start
OL,7,Fon Sunday, before turning cloudier
OL,8,Fwith rain pushing into southern parts
OL,9,Fthrough Monday into Tuesday. Light
OL,10,Fwinds throughout.
